{"topicBn":"ম্যাট্রিক্স ও নির্ণায়ক","stem":"A = [[2, 3], [1, 4]] হলে |A| = কত?","options":{"A":"৫","B":"১১","C":"৮","D":"−৫"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"|A| = ২ × ৪ − ৩ × ১ = ৮ − ৩ = ৫।"},
{"topicBn":"ম্যাট্রিক্স ও নির্ণায়ক","stem":"দুটি ম্যাট্রিক্স A ও B-এর গুণফলের ট্রান্সপোজ (AB)ᵀ = কত?","options":{"A":"AᵀBᵀ","B":"BᵀAᵀ","C":"AB","D":"BA"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"ট্রান্সপোজের নিয়ম: (AB)ᵀ = BᵀAᵀ, অর্থাৎ ক্রম উল্টে যায়।"},
{"topicBn":"ম্যাট্রিক্স ও নির্ণায়ক","stem":"কোনো বর্গ ম্যাট্রিক্সকে ব্যতিক্রমী (singular) বলা হয় কখন?","options":{"A":"নির্ণায়ক ১ হলে","B":"নির্ণায়ক শূন্য হলে","C":"সব ভুক্তি শূন্য হলে","D":"ম্যাট্রিক্সটি প্রতিসম হলে"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"|A| = 0 হলে ম্যাট্রিক্সটি ব্যতিক্রমী; তার বিপরীত ম্যাট্রিক্স থাকে না।"},
{"topicBn":"সরলরেখা","stem":"(1, 2) ও (4, 6) বিন্দুদ্বয়ের মধ্যবর্তী দূরত্ব কত?","options":{"A":"৩","B":"৪","C":"৫","D":"৭"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"দূরত্ব = √[(৪−১)² + (৬−২)²] = √(৯ + ১৬) = √২৫ = ৫।"},
{"topicBn":"সরলরেখা","stem":"2x + 3y = 6 রেখার ঢাল কত?","options":{"A":"২/৩","B":"−২/৩","C":"৩/২","D":"−৩/২"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"ax + by + c = 0 রেখার ঢাল −a/b = −২/৩।"},
{"topicBn":"সরলরেখা","stem":"(2, 4) ও (6, 8) বিন্দুদ্বয়ের সংযোগ রেখাংশের মধ্যবিন্দু কোনটি?","options":{"A":"(৪, ৬)","B":"(৩, ৫)","C":"(৮, ১২)","D":"(২, ২)"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"মধ্যবিন্দু = ((২+৬)/২, (৪+৮)/২) = (৪, ৬)।"},
{"topicBn":"সরলরেখা","stem":"দুটি রেখার ঢাল m₁ ও m₂; রেখাদ্বয় পরস্পর লম্ব হওয়ার শর্ত কী?","options":{"A":"m₁ = m₂","B":"m₁m₂ = 1","C":"m₁m₂ = −1","D":"m₁ + m₂ = 0"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"লম্ব রেখার ঢালের গুণফল −১; সমান্তরাল রেখার ঢাল সমান।"},
{"topicBn":"বৃত্ত","stem":"x² + y² − 4x + 6y − 12 = 0 বৃত্তের ব্যাসার্ধ কত?","options":{"A":"৩","B":"৪","C":"৫","D":"√১২"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"কেন্দ্র (২, −৩); ব্যাসার্ধ = √(২² + ৩² + ১২) = √২৫ = ৫।","shortcut":"x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0 এর ব্যাসার্ধ √(g² + f² − c)"},
{"topicBn":"বৃত্ত","stem":"x² + y² − 4x + 6y − 12 = 0 বৃত্তের কেন্দ্র কোনটি?","options":{"A":"(২, −৩)","B":"(−২, ৩)","C":"(৪, −৬)","D":"(−৪, ৬)"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0 এর কেন্দ্র (−g, −f); এখানে g = −২, f = ৩, তাই কেন্দ্র (২, −৩)।"},
{"topicBn":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","stem":"tan 45° + cos 60° = কত?","options":{"A":"১","B":"১.৫","C":"২","D":"০.৫"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"tan 45° = ১ এবং cos 60° = ১/২; যোগফল ১.৫।"},
{"topicBn":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","stem":"sin(A + B) = কত?","options":{"A":"sinA cosB + cosA sinB","B":"sinA sinB + cosA cosB","C":"cosA cosB − sinA sinB","D":"sinA cosB − cosA sinB"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"sin(A + B) = sinA cosB + cosA sinB; cos(A + B) = cosA cosB − sinA sinB।"},
{"topicBn":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","stem":"tan x ফাংশনের পর্যায় কত?","options":{"A":"π/2","B":"π","C":"2π","D":"4π"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"tan(x + π) = tan x, তাই tan x-এর পর্যায় π; sin x ও cos x-এর পর্যায় 2π।"},
{"topicBn":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","stem":"cos 2θ-কে sin θ-এর মাধ্যমে প্রকাশ করলে কোনটি সঠিক?","options":{"A":"1 − 2sin²θ","B":"2sin²θ − 1","C":"1 + 2sin²θ","D":"2sinθ cosθ"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"cos 2θ = cos²θ − sin²θ = 1 − 2sin²θ = 2cos²θ − 1।"},
{"topicBn":"ত্রিকোণমিতি","stem":"sin 15° cos 15° = কত?","options":{"A":"১/২","B":"১/৪","C":"√৩/৪","D":"১"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"sinθ cosθ = ½ sin2θ; তাই ½ sin 30° = ½ × ½ = ১/৪।","shortcut":"sinθ cosθ = ½ sin2θ"},
{"topicBn":"সীমা","stem":"lim(x→0) (sin x)/x = কত?","options":{"A":"০","B":"১","C":"অসীম","D":"অনির্ণেয়"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"এটি একটি মৌলিক সীমা; x রেডিয়ানে হলে lim(x→0) sin x / x = ১।"},
{"topicBn":"সীমা","stem":"lim(x→2) (x² − 4)/(x − 2) = কত?","options":{"A":"০","B":"২","C":"৪","D":"অসীম"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"(x² − 4)/(x − 2) = x + 2; x → 2 হলে মান ৪।"},
{"topicBn":"অন্তরীকরণ","stem":"d/dx (x³) = কত?","options":{"A":"x²","B":"3x²","C":"3x³","D":"x⁴/4"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"d/dx (xⁿ) = nxⁿ⁻¹; তাই d/dx (x³) = 3x²।"},
{"topicBn":"অন্তরীকরণ","stem":"d/dx (sin x) = কত?","options":{"A":"cos x","B":"−cos x","C":"−sin x","D":"sec²x"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"sin x-এর অন্তরজ cos x; cos x-এর অন্তরজ −sin x।"},
{"topicBn":"অন্তরীকরণ","stem":"d/dx (e²ˣ) = কত?","options":{"A":"e²ˣ","B":"2e²ˣ","C":"2xe²ˣ","D":"e²ˣ/2"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"শৃঙ্খল নিয়মে d/dx (eᵃˣ) = aeᵃˣ; তাই 2e²ˣ।"},
{"topicBn":"অন্তরীকরণ","stem":"d/dx (ln x) = কত?","options":{"A":"x","B":"1/x","C":"ln x","D":"eˣ"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"স্বাভাবিক লগারিদমের অন্তরজ d/dx (ln x) = 1/x (x > 0)।"},
{"topicBn":"অন্তরীকরণের প্রয়োগ","stem":"f(x) = x² − 4x + 3 ফাংশনের সর্বনিম্ন মান কত?","options":{"A":"৩","B":"০","C":"−১","D":"−৪"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"f'(x) = 2x − 4 = 0 ⇒ x = 2; f(2) = ৪ − ৮ + ৩ = −১।"},
{"topicBn":"যোগজীকরণ","stem":"∫ x dx = কত?","options":{"A":"x² + c","B":"x²/2 + c","C":"1 + c","D":"2x + c"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"∫ xⁿ dx = xⁿ⁺¹/(n + 1) + c; n = 1 হলে x²/2 + c।"},
{"topicBn":"যোগজীকরণ","stem":"∫₀¹ x² dx = কত?","options":{"A":"১/২","B":"১/৩","C":"১","D":"২/৩"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"[x³/3] ০ থেকে ১ পর্যন্ত = ১/৩ − ০ = ১/৩।"},
{"topicBn":"যোগজীকরণ","stem":"∫ cos x dx = কত?","options":{"A":"sin x + c","B":"−sin x + c","C":"cos x + c","D":"tan x + c"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"d/dx (sin x) = cos x, তাই ∫ cos x dx = sin x + c।"},
{"topicBn":"যোগজীকরণ","stem":"∫ (1/x) dx = কত?","options":{"A":"x⁻² + c","B":"ln|x| + c","C":"−1/x² + c","D":"eˣ + c"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"d/dx (ln|x|) = 1/x, তাই ∫ dx/x = ln|x| + c।"},
{"topicBn":"জটিল সংখ্যা","stem":"i¹⁰ = কত? (i = √−1)","options":{"A":"১","B":"−১","C":"i","D":"−i"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"i⁴ = ১, তাই i¹⁰ = i⁸ × i² = ১ × (−১) = −১।","shortcut":"ঘাতকে ৪ দিয়ে ভাগ করে ভাগশেষ দেখুন: ০→১, ১→i, ২→−১, ৩→−i"},
{"topicBn":"জটিল সংখ্যা","stem":"3 + 4i জটিল সংখ্যার পরমমান কত?","options":{"A":"৫","B":"৭","C":"১","D":"২৫"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"|a + bi| = √(a² + b²) = √(৯ + ১৬) = ৫।"},
{"topicBn":"জটিল সংখ্যা","stem":"2 − 3i জটিল সংখ্যার অনুবন্ধী (conjugate) কোনটি?","options":{"A":"−2 + 3i","B":"2 + 3i","C":"−2 − 3i","D":"3 − 2i"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"a + bi-এর অনুবন্ধী a − bi; তাই 2 − 3i-এর অনুবন্ধী 2 + 3i।"},
{"topicBn":"বহুপদী ও সমীকরণ","stem":"x² − 5x + 6 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয়ের যোগফল কত?","options":{"A":"৬","B":"−৫","C":"৫","D":"−৬"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"ax² + bx + c = 0 এর মূলদ্বয়ের যোগফল −b/a = ৫ এবং গুণফল c/a = ৬।"},
{"topicBn":"বহুপদী ও সমীকরণ","stem":"ax² + bx + c = 0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয় কাল্পনিক হবে যদি—","options":{"A":"b² − 4ac > 0","B":"b² − 4ac = 0","C":"b² − 4ac < 0","D":"b² − 4ac একটি পূর্ণবর্গ"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"নিশ্চায়ক b² − 4ac ঋণাত্মক হলে মূলদ্বয় কাল্পনিক ও অনুবন্ধী জোড়।"},
{"topicBn":"বহুপদী ও সমীকরণ","stem":"x² − 7x + 12 = 0 সমীকরণের মূলদ্বয় α ও β হলে α² + β² = কত?","options":{"A":"২৫","B":"৪৯","C":"২৪","D":"৭৩"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"α + β = ৭, αβ = ১২; α² + β² = (α + β)² − 2αβ = ৪৯ − ২৪ = ২৫।"},
{"topicBn":"বিন্যাস ও সমাবেশ","stem":"⁵P₂ এর মান কত?","options":{"A":"১০","B":"২০","C":"২৫","D":"৬০"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"ⁿPᵣ = n!/(n − r)! ⇒ ⁵P₂ = ৫ × ৪ = ২০।"},
{"topicBn":"বিন্যাস ও সমাবেশ","stem":"⁶C₂ এর মান কত?","options":{"A":"১২","B":"১৫","C":"৩০","D":"৩৬"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"⁶C₂ = (৬ × ৫)/(২ × ১) = ১৫।"},
{"topicBn":"বিন্যাস ও সমাবেশ","stem":"BOOK শব্দের অক্ষরগুলো কত প্রকারে সাজানো যায়?","options":{"A":"২৪","B":"১২","C":"৬","D":"৮"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"৪টি অক্ষরের মধ্যে O দুবার আছে; বিন্যাস = ৪!/২! = ২৪/২ = ১২।"},
{"topicBn":"সম্ভাবনা","stem":"দুটি মুদ্রা একসাথে নিক্ষেপ করলে দুটিতেই হেড আসার সম্ভাবনা কত?","options":{"A":"১/২","B":"১/৩","C":"১/৪","D":"৩/৪"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"নমুনা ক্ষেত্র {HH, HT, TH, TT}; অনুকূল ১টি, তাই সম্ভাবনা ১/৪।"},
{"topicBn":"সম্ভাবনা","stem":"দুটি ছক্কা একসাথে নিক্ষেপ করলে উঠা সংখ্যার যোগফল ৭ হওয়ার সম্ভাবনা কত?","options":{"A":"১/৬","B":"১/১২","C":"৭/৩৬","D":"১/৯"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"মোট ৩৬টি ফলাফল; যোগফল ৭: (১,৬),(২,৫),(৩,৪),(৪,৩),(৫,২),(৬,১) = ৬টি; সম্ভাবনা ৬/৩৬ = ১/৬।"},
{"topicBn":"দ্বিপদী বিস্তৃতি","stem":"(x + y)⁸ এর বিস্তৃতিতে মোট কতটি পদ থাকে?","options":{"A":"৮","B":"৯","C":"১৬","D":"৭"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"(a + b)ⁿ এর বিস্তৃতিতে n + 1টি পদ থাকে; তাই ৯টি।"},
{"topicBn":"দ্বিপদী বিস্তৃতি","stem":"(1 + x)⁴ এর বিস্তৃতিতে মধ্যপদের সহগ কত?","options":{"A":"৪","B":"৬","C":"১","D":"১২"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"৫টি পদের মধ্যপদ তৃতীয় পদ; সহগ ⁴C₂ = ৬।"},
{"topicBn":"ভেক্টর","stem":"2i + 3j + 6k ভেক্টরের মান কত?","options":{"A":"৫","B":"৭","C":"১১","D":"৪৯"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"মান = √(৪ + ৯ + ৩৬) = √৪৯ = ৭।"},
{"topicBn":"কনিক","stem":"y² = 8x পরাবৃত্তের উপকেন্দ্র (focus) কোনটি?","options":{"A":"(৮, ০)","B":"(২, ০)","C":"(০, ২)","D":"(৪, ০)"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"TRICKY","explanationBn":"y² = 4ax এর উপকেন্দ্র (a, 0); এখানে 4a = ৮ ⇒ a = ২, তাই (২, ০)।"},
{"topicBn":"কনিক","stem":"x²/25 + y²/9 = 1 উপবৃত্তের উৎকেন্দ্রিকতা কত?","options":{"A":"৩/৫","B":"৪/৫","C":"৫/৪","D":"৯/২৫"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"HIGH","explanationBn":"a² = ২৫, b² = ৯; e = √(1 − b²/a²) = √(1 − ৯/২৫) = √(১৬/২৫) = ৪/৫।"},
{"topicBn":"ফাংশন","stem":"f(x) = √(x − 2) ফাংশনের ডোমেন কোনটি?","options":{"A":"x > 2","B":"x ≥ 2","C":"x ≤ 2","D":"সব বাস্তব সংখ্যা"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"বর্গমূলের ভিতরের রাশি অঋণাত্মক হতে হবে: x − 2 ≥ 0 ⇒ x ≥ 2।"},
{"topicBn":"ফাংশন","stem":"f(x) = 2x + 3 হলে f⁻¹(x) = কত?","options":{"A":"(x − 3)/2","B":"(x + 3)/2","C":"2x − 3","D":"1/(2x + 3)"},"answer":"A","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"y = 2x + 3 ⇒ x = (y − 3)/2; তাই f⁻¹(x) = (x − 3)/2।"},
{"topicBn":"লগারিদম","stem":"log₂ 8 = কত?","options":{"A":"২","B":"৩","C":"৪","D":"৮"},"answer":"B","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"২³ = ৮, তাই log₂ 8 = ৩।"},
{"topicBn":"স্থিতিবিদ্যা","stem":"পরস্পর লম্বভাবে ক্রিয়ারত ৩ N ও ৪ N বলের লব্ধি কত?","options":{"A":"৭ N","B":"১ N","C":"৫ N","D":"১২ N"},"answer":"C","difficulty":"STANDARD","explanationBn":"লম্ব বলের লব্ধি R = √(P² + Q²) = √(৯ + ১৬) = ৫ N।"}
]
